stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> loading: screen pushed
    loading --> loaded: 200 / 304
    loading --> loaded_stale: offline, cache hit
    loading --> failed: offline, no cache / error
    failed --> loading: Try again
    loaded --> loaded: refresh / action then=refresh
    loaded_stale --> loaded: refresh succeeds
    loaded --> [*]: back / action then=pop
    note right of loaded
        Errors while already loaded
        show a toast; content stays.
    end note
